eholder:"Example: A broke programmer receives text messages from three days in the future…",revisionPlaceholder:"Describe what to change about the characters, conflict, episodes, or season arc…",commonSkillsLabel:"Also follow these (multi-select)",chatProvider:"Chat provider",chatModel:"Chat model",planningBusy:"Planning…",generatePlan:"Generate planning card",revisePlan:"Update card from chat",markdownContract:"Agreed format: ```short_drama_plan JSON```. A parsed block becomes a confirmation card.",planInvalid:"The model did not return a valid short_drama_plan block.",planFailure_no_json:"The model talked but did not produce plan data this turn. Your message is back in the box; send it again or rephrase.",planFailure_malformed_json:"The plan data came back malformed and could not be parsed. The raw reply is above; ask the model to resend.",planFailure_truncated:"The model output was cut off, so the plan data is incomplete. This happens with many episodes; reduce the episode count or ask for the season arc only.",planFailure_missing_title:"The plan data has no title, so it cannot be saved. Ask for a title and send again.",ideaRequired:"Write down the story idea first.",planSaved:"The plan was confirmed and saved.",planWaiting:"Waiting for a plan",planWaitingHint:"Define genre, audience, episodes, conflict and season arc on the left.",plannerName:"Drama planning assistant",plannerWelcome:"Share the story idea, genre, and audience. I will clarify key choices and turn our agreement into the planning card.",you:"You",planGeneratedMessage:"I created a planning card for {title} from our conversation. Keep chatting to revise it, or confirm when ready.",revisionStarter:"I want to adjust: ",logline:"Logline",coreConflict:"Core conflict",seriesArc:"Season arc",revise:"Revise",confirmAndSave:"Confirm and save",minutesPerEpisode:"About {count} min per episode",plannerSystem:`You are a short-drama showrunner. Keep revising the plan across the whole conversation and answer the latest request with a complete plan.
Output rules: the code fence language tag must be exactly the single word short_drama_plan, never json, and write no prose before or after the block. Put exactly one JSON object inside it.
JSON fields: title, genre, format, episodeCount, episodeDurationSeconds, logline, coreConflict, audience, tone, arc, episodes, characters. title is required and must not be empty. episodes is an array of objects with title and summary; keep each summary under 40 words and, when the episode count is high, prioritise a complete JSON object over fully written episodes. characters is an array of the named, recurring cast, each with name and role (role is a one-line position, under 12 words); do not list walk-ons such as a nurse or a driver. Backstory and visual identity are drafted separately, not here. Keep every field concrete and shootable, never generic.`,draftSaved:"Draft saved.",draftAdopted:"The draft was adopted into the character sheet.",draftAlreadyAdopted:"That version was already adopted.",draftDiscarded:"The draft was discarded. Committed content is unchanged.",draftPending:"Draft not adopted yet",draftPendingHint:"Committed content has not changed. Review the differences before adopting.",draftBadge:"draft",showDiff:"Show differences",hideDiff:"Hide differences",diffEmpty:"(was empty)",adoptDraft:"Adopt draft",discardDraft:"Discard draft",characterCoCreation:"Character co-creation",characterCoCreationHint:"Talk the character through and edit by hand at any time. Generated content lands in a draft; nothing is committed until you adopt it.",characterAssistant:"Character assistant",askCharacter:"Send",characterBusy:"Thinking about this character…",reasoningLabel:"Thinking",structuredIncoming:"Writing the character sheet…",stopRequest:"Stop",characterAskPlaceholder:"For example: make her colder and terser, and leave the visual prompt alone…",characterAskRequired:"Write what you want the AI to do first.",selectCharacterFirst:"Pick a character on the left first.",characterDraftInvalid:"The model returned a malformed character block. The draft was left alone.",characterDraftReady:"I updated the character draft. Review the differences before adopting.",characterDr